segment.source:
::For an instant you see surprise in your eyes. The next, it is already gone.::

Such a poor decision, $(context.player.Name); you went through all this only to change your mind now. Magnificent Tchort, I don't think I have ever seen anything like it before.

The rassophores will lead you out now, $(context.player.Name). Tchort guide you.&lt;end&gt;

